{"4489450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voxelion", "steam_appid": 4489450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxelion</strong> is a city-builder / RTS set in a fully destructible voxel world where you can shape everything around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a few structures and turn them into a living, working city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building you place becomes part of a larger system - production, logistics, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.poster.avif?t=1783788349\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.webm?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.mp4?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell your settlers to tear down mountains, fill holes, and reshape the land to your advantage.<br>Turn the terrain into your defense… or your next problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your sandbox - use it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend what you’ve built</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.poster.avif?t=1783788349\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.webm?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.mp4?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlement won’t stay safe for long.<br>Raiders will come - smarter, stronger, and ready to exploit your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defenses, raise an army, and use the terrain itself to remind them whose land this is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of your people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers do all the work - so keeping them alive is a good start.<br>Give them food, rest, and the tools they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy settler is a hard-working settler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your production flowing by managing storage and transport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor placement leads to bottlenecks, wasted time, and a collapsing supply chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire haulers to keep your workers focused on production instead of running around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxelion is being built as a living sandbox world where civilizations evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, it’s about a world that doesn’t stay static — it grows, reacts, and changes alongside the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world becomes a living ecosystem of settlements, factions, and points of interest, where no region feels empty or meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilizations rise from small medieval settlements and gradually develop into larger steampunk or magic-based cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is meant to feel different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and AI-driven actions constantly reshape the world and how it behaves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxelion</strong> is a city-builder / RTS set in a fully destructible voxel world where you can shape everything around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a few structures and turn them into a living, working city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building you place becomes part of a larger system - production, logistics, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.poster.avif?t=1783788349\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.webm?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/0383a9642e2b2ad05ee14b29e06bc313.mp4?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell your settlers to tear down mountains, fill holes, and reshape the land to your advantage.<br>Turn the terrain into your defense… or your next problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your sandbox - use it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend what you’ve built</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.poster.avif?t=1783788349\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.webm?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/extras/861222897114f88eceaf7f195f5f0a8d.mp4?t=1783788349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlement won’t stay safe for long.<br>Raiders will come - smarter, stronger, and ready to exploit your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defenses, raise an army, and use the terrain itself to remind them whose land this is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of your people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers do all the work - so keeping them alive is a good start.<br>Give them food, rest, and the tools they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy settler is a hard-working settler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your production flowing by managing storage and transport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor placement leads to bottlenecks, wasted time, and a collapsing supply chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire haulers to keep your workers focused on production instead of running around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxelion is being built as a living sandbox world where civilizations evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, it’s about a world that doesn’t stay static — it grows, reacts, and changes alongside the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world becomes a living ecosystem of settlements, factions, and points of interest, where no region feels empty or meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilizations rise from small medieval settlements and gradually develop into larger steampunk or magic-based cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is meant to feel different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and AI-driven actions constantly reshape the world and how it behaves.</p>", "short_description": "Build, mine and defend your colony in a fully destructible voxel world. Shape the terrain, manage production chains and face unpredictable challenges in the world of Voxelion.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/91d6b2729fc1ddcebe94e45852a34a3f8061206a/header.jpg?t=1783788349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/4fca8a04722ffcb08f805138aec903c5011ab324/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783788349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489450/4fca8a04722ffcb08f805138aec903c5011ab324/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783788349", "website": "https://voxelion.info/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 11/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD RYZEN series 1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 11/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD RYZEN series 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requ